      <data key="d2">BE-TR2_3 is a 2-winding power transformer installed in substation PP_Brussels.&lt;SEP&gt;BE-TR2_3 is a ratio tap changer installed on transformer winding 2, with steps from 1 to 33 and neutral step 17.&gt;</data>
