    <node id="PP_Amsterdam">
      <data key="d0">PP_Amsterdam</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">PP_Amsterdam is a substation location where power transformer NL_TR2_2 is installed.&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Amsterdam is a substation that contains busbar sections NL-Busbar_3 and NL-Busbar_5.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Amsterdam is a substation location where power transformer NL-TR2_1 is installed.&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Amsterdam is a substation where power transformer NL_TR2_3 is installed.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Amsterdam is a substation that contains voltage levels including 15.8 and 400.0 and hosts equipment such as machine NL-G1 and multiple energy consumers.&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Amsterdam is a substation where transformer NL-TR2_1 and synchronous machines NL-G3 and NL-G2 are installed.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Amsterdam is a substation that includes multiple voltage levels and is connected to several topological nodes and devices.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-003</data>
