    <node id="Winding 2 Of NL-TR2_1">
      <data key="d0">Winding 2 Of NL-TR2_1</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Winding 2 Of NL-TR2_1 is the second winding of transformer NL-TR2_1, rated at 220 kV and 320 MVA, connected to topological node NL-Busbar_2.&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-006</data>
