      <data key="d2">Voltage Level 15.8 is a voltage level within Substation Pp_Amsterdam that operates at a nominal voltage of 15.75 kV.&lt;SEP&gt;Voltage Level 15.8 is an operating voltage level at substation PP_Amsterdam for synchronous machines NL-G3 and NL-G2.&gt;</data>
