      <data key="d2">Voltage Level 10.5 is a voltage level within substation PP_Brussels where busbar section BE-Busbar_4 is installed and operates at 10.5 kV.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Voltage Level 10.5 is a voltage level within Substation Pp_Brussels that operates at a nominal voltage of 10.5 kV.&lt;SEP&gt;Voltage Level 10.5 is an operating voltage level at substation PP_Brussels for synchronous machine BE-G1.&gt;</data>
