    <node id="PP_Brussels">
      <data key="d0">PP_Brussels</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">PP_Brussels is a substation that contains multiple busbar sections including Usbar_6, BE-Busbar_3, N1230992288, BE-Busbar_1, and N1230992291.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Brussels is a substation that contains voltage level 10.5 where busbar section BE-Busbar_4 is installed.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Brussels is a substation location where several power transformers are installed.&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Brussels is a substation where power transformers BE-TR3_1 and BE-TR2_1 are installed.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Brussels is a substation that contains voltage levels including 21.0 and 225.0 and hosts equipment such as machine BE-G2 and energy consumer BE-Load_2.&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Brussels is a substation where synchronous machine BE-G1 operates.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;PP_Brussels is a substation that includes voltage levels 380.0 and 110.0 and hosts linear shunt compensators and energy consumers.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-008</data>
