      <data key="d0">BE-Busbar_4</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">BE-Busbar_4 is a busbar section installed in voltage level 10.5 of substation PP_Brussels and operates at a nominal voltage of 10.5 kV, corresponding to topological node BE-Busbar_4.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;BE-Busbar_4 is a busbar section installed in voltage level 10.5 of substation PP_Brussels and operates at a nominal voltage of 10.5 kV.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;BE-Busbar_4 is a topological node to which Winding 2 of transformer BE-TR2_3 is connected.&lt;SEP&gt;BE-Busbar_4 is a topological node to which synchronous machine BE-G1 is connected.&gt;</data>
