    <node id="BE-Busbar_2">
      <data key="d0">BE-Busbar_2</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">BE-Busbar_2 is a topological node that serves as one terminal of AC line segments BE-Line_2 and BE-Line_6.&lt;SEP&gt;BE-Busbar_2 is a busbar section installed in voltage level 220.0 of substation Anvers and operates at a nominal voltage of 225 kV, and it is also used as a topological node identifier.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;BE-Busbar_2 is a busbar section in station Anvers that operates at a nominal voltage of 225 kV and corresponds to a topological node named BE-Busbar_2.&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;BE-Busbar_2 is a topological node that connects energy consumer L-1230804819 within substation Anvers.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-003</data>
