      <data key="d2">BE-Line_1 is an AC line segment that connects topological node BE-Busbar_2 to topological node TN_Border_ST23, with length 22 km, resistance 2.2 ohm, reactance 68.2 ohm, and operating voltage 220 kV.&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-be0add59cbaa36750f7e1a8365dca728-chunk-002</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1781190013</data>
